A||||8||Cooter||First victory in on road acceleration contest (not a race!)||||1||
Z||000000||Cooter||07-07-2000||12:55 AM||||Going out for a burger tonight and start to pass a mid 70's Camaro. I was in the right lane and as I start by, he throttles up and pulls ahead. I see the distinct Flowmaster mufflers underneath and the rear window is covered with stickers (Got Rice?). I dont even mess with catching up, it was late and I wanted my burger. As fate would have it, we get caught at the next red light. I hang back and try to wait for the light so I can roll through the intersection- but I had to stop anyway. Light goes green- I roll off in first gear and he punches it. I jam the throttle and grab second when the shift light kicks in. I let off in third, so I would not exceed the posted speed limit and the guy riding has the nerve to say: Is that a four cylinder????<BR>I said yeah right, four cylinders. He said- Damn! Must have a turbo or something! Pull over. . .<BR>They turned out to be pretty cool guys, just out goofing off. The driver made all the usual excuses- shifted early, low octane fuel, carb bogged down. . .<BR>His friend finally said- Look man, I knew you were toasted when I saw the guys tattle tale tach light up! He aint playing around. <BR>Fiero 1, Camaro 0||||reg||1
Z||000001||Dan86gt3.8||07-07-2000||03:22 AM||||what are you packing cooter?  Are you a 3.4 guy?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cooter||07-07-2000||08:11 AM||||Yep, 3.4 with the 4.10 four speed. The guy just could not believe that his built 350 got smacked by a v6! He started talking about his engine- bored 30 over, 69 z-28 302 heads, headers, big Crane Cam and. . . . a stock low rise cast iron intake with the world famous Quadrajet! I love it.||||reg||1
