Z||000007||rogergarrison||07-10-2000||08:12 AM||||i know the feeling, its great isnt it. yesterday I was just cruising home on interstate at 70mph, got to a stretch in traffic and turned it up just a little, like 80. next thing i knew I had a guy in a new Monte Carlo SS on my tail flashing his lites, I hit the gas and took off, last thing i saw was his car disappearing behind while I was going thru 140, haha. when i slowed back down to speed limit about 15 minutes later , here he come again, going like a bat out of h--l, i just laughed at him, they never learn !!||||reg||1
